{"id":"H8060","lemma":"שַׁמַּי","transliteration":"shammay","sayIt":"sham-MAY","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shammai","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.28;\nson of: Onam (H0208H);\nbrother of: Jada (H3047);\nfather of: Nadab (H5070I) and Abishur (H0051)\n§ Shammai = \"desolate\"\n1) a Judaite, son of Onam and descendant of Jerahmeel\n2) a Judaite, son of Rekem, father of Maon, and descendant of Jerahmeel's brother, Caleb\n3) a Judaite, son of Mered and brother of Miriam and Ishbah","glosses":["shammai"],"count":5,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammai","kjv":"Shammai"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shammai","kjv":"of Shammai"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":44,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammai","kjv":"Shammai"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shammai","kjv":"of Shammai"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammai","kjv":"and Shammai"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:28","note":"The sons of Onam were Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai: Nadab and Abishur.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0051","lemma":"אֲבִישׁוּר","transliteration":"avishur","gloss":"Abishur"},{"id":"H0208","lemma":"אוֹנָם","transliteration":"onam","gloss":"Onam"},{"id":"H1332","lemma":"בִּתְיָה","transliteration":"bityah","gloss":"Bithiah"},{"id":"H2268","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶר","transliteration":"chever","gloss":"Heber"},{"id":"H3047","lemma":"יָדָע","transliteration":"yada","gloss":"Jada"},{"id":"H3354","lemma":"יְקוּתִיאֵל","transliteration":"yequtiel","gloss":"Jekuthiel"},{"id":"H3382","lemma":"יֶ֫רֶד","transliteration":"yered","gloss":"Jared"},{"id":"H3431","lemma":"יִשְׁבַּח","transliteration":"yishbach","gloss":"Ishbah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8060H","gloss":"Shammai","relation":"H8060H ="},{"id":"H8060I","gloss":"Shammai","relation":"H8060I ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tag